{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-science","title":"睡眠科学","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 睡眠科学\n\n睡眠科学是研究人类睡眠机制、功能及其对健康影响的跨学科领域，融合了神经科学、分子生物学、心理学和临床医学的前沿知识。\n\n## 学习目标\n\n本 Hub 旨在帮助学习者系统掌握以下核心知识：\n\n- **睡眠结构**：理解 NREM/REM 睡眠阶段的生理特征与功能分工\n- **昼夜节律生物学**：掌握生物钟的分子机制、光信号通路与时间型差异\n- **睡眠与健康**：认识睡眠对认知、代谢、免疫系统的深层影响及常见睡眠障碍\n- **睡眠优化**：了解循证的睡眠改善策略，包括 CBT-I、睡眠追踪技术与睡眠卫生实践\n\n## 知识框架\n\n睡眠科学的核心理论基础是 **双过程模型（Two-Process Model）**：\n\n1. **过程 S（稳态驱动）**：清醒时间越长，adenosine 积累越多，睡眠压力越大\n2. **过程 C（昼夜节律）**：视交叉上核（SCN）驱动的约 24 小时内源性节律\n\n两个过程的交互决定了我们何时入睡、何时醒来、以及睡眠的质量与结构。\n\n## 章节导航\n\n| 章节   | 主题           | 关键词                         |\n| ------ | -------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 第一章 | 睡眠结构       | 睡眠阶段、周期、NREM、REM      |\n| 第二章 | 昼夜节律生物学 | SCN、时钟基因、褪黑素、时间型  |\n| 第三章 | 睡眠与健康     | 认知功能、代谢、免疫、睡眠障碍 |\n| 第四章 | 睡眠优化       | 睡眠卫生、追踪技术、CBT-I      |\n\n## 适用人群\n\n本 Hub 面向对睡眠科学感兴趣的自学者，不要求医学背景，但需要基本的生物学常识。内容力求兼顾科学严谨性与可读性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-architecture","title":"睡眠结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-stages-and-cycles","title":"睡眠阶段与周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/sleep-stages-and-cycles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nrem-deep-sleep-functions","title":"NREM 深度睡眠功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/nrem-deep-sleep-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rem-sleep-and-dreaming","title":"REM 睡眠与梦境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/rem-sleep-and-dreaming"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"circadian-biology","title":"昼夜节律生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"suprachiasmatic-nucleus-and-clock-genes","title":"视交叉上核与时钟基因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/suprachiasmatic-nucleus-and-clock-genes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"melatonin-and-light-signaling","title":"褪黑素与光信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/melatonin-and-light-signaling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chronotypes-and-social-jetlag","title":"时间型与社会性时差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/circadian-biology/chronotypes-and-social-jetlag"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-and-health","title":"睡眠与健康","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-and-cognitive-function","title":"睡眠与认知功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-and-cognitive-function"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-metabolism-and-immunity","title":"睡眠、代谢与免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-metabolism-and-immunity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sleep-disorders-overview","title":"睡眠障碍概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-and-health/sleep-disorders-overview"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sleep-optimization","title":"睡眠优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-hygiene-evidence-base","title":"睡眠卫生的循证基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-optimization/sleep-hygiene-evidence-base"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-tracking-and-measurement","title":"睡眠追踪与测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-optimization/sleep-tracking-and-measurement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-behavioral-therapy-insomnia","title":"失眠认知行为疗法 CBT-I","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-optimization/cognitive-behavioral-therapy-insomnia"}]}]}